#: Voicemail.class.php:2061
msgid ""
"Command specified runs after a user changes their password. The arguments "
"passed to the application are: [context] [mailbox] [newpassword] Note: This "
"will also update the voicemail.conf file"
msgstr ""
"指定的命令會在使用者變更其密碼後執行。傳遞給應用程式的參數為：[context] [mailbox] [newpassword] 附註：此操作也會一併更新 voicemail.conf 檔案"

#: Voicemail.class.php:2068
msgid ""
"Command specified runs before a user changes their password and can be used "
"to impose security restrictions on voicemail password. The arguments passed "
"to the application are: [mailbox] [context] [oldpassword] [newpassword]. The "
"script should print VALID to stdout to indicate that the new password is "
"acceptable.  If the password is considered too weak, the script should print "
"INVALID to stdout. "
msgstr ""
"指定的命令會在使用者變更其密碼之前執行，可用於對語音信箱密碼施加安全限制。傳遞給應用程式的參數為：[mailbox] [context] [oldpassword] [newpassword]。指令碼應將 VALID 輸出至 stdout 以表示新密碼可接受。若密碼被視為太弱，指令碼應將 INVALID 輸出至 stdout。"

