#: page.voicemail.php:268
msgid ""
"If mailboxes are changed anywhere outside of app_voicemail, then this option "
"must be enabled for MWI to work.  This enables polling mailboxes for "
"changes.  Normally, it will expect that changes are only made when someone "
"called in to one of the Voicemail applications. Examples of situations that "
"would require this option are web interfaces to Voicemail or an email client "
"in the case of using IMAP storage."
msgstr ""
"若信箱在 app_voicemail 以外的任何地方變更，則必須啟用此選項 MWI 才能運作。這會啟用輪詢信箱以偵測變更。通常會預期只有在有人撥號進入語音信箱應用程式時才會發生變更。需要此選項的情境範例：網頁語音信箱介面或使用 IMAP 儲存時的電子郵件使用者端。"

#: Voicemail.class.php:2160
msgid ""
"If mailboxes are changed anywhere outside of app_voicemail, then this option "
"must be enabled for MWI to work. This enables polling mailboxes for "
"changes.  Normally, it will expect that changes are only made when someone "
"called in to one of the voicemail applications. Examples of situations that "
"would require this option are web interfaces to voicemail or an email client "
"in the case of using IMAP storage."
msgstr ""
"若信箱在 app_voicemail 以外的任何地方變更，則必須啟用此選項 MWI 才能運作。這會啟用輪詢信箱以偵測變更。通常會預期只有在有人撥號進入語音信箱應用程式時才會發生變更。需要此選項的情境範例：網頁語音信箱介面或使用 IMAP 儲存時的電子郵件使用者端。"

#: functions.inc.php:539
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If set to \"no\" then when the user dials %s to access their own voicemail, "
"they will not be asked to enter a password. This does not apply to %s calls, "
"which will always prompt for a password. For security reasons, this should "
"probably be set to \"yes\" in an environment where other users will have "
"physical access to this extension."
msgstr ""
"若設為「no」，當使用者撥打 %s 存取自己的語音信箱時，系統不會要求輸入密碼。這不適用 %s 來電，這類來電永遠會要求輸入密碼。基於安全考量，若其他使用者可實際接觸此分機，則應將此設為「yes」。"

#: ucp/views/vmsettings.php:49
msgid ""
"If set to \"yes\" the Voicemail Pane will refresh automatically when new "
"voicemails are retrieved"
msgstr "若設為「yes」，語音信箱窗格會在取得新語音信箱時自動重新整理"

#: functions.inc.php:562
#: ucp/views/vmsettings.php:44
msgid ""
"If set to \"yes\" the message will be deleted from the Voicemailbox (after "
"having been emailed). Provides functionality that allows a user to receive "
"their Voicemail via email alone, rather than having the Voicemail able to be "
"retrieved from the Webinterface or the Extension handset.  CAUTION: MUST "
"HAVE attach Voicemail to email SET TO YES OTHERWISE YOUR MESSAGES WILL BE "
"LOST FOREVER."
msgstr ""
"若設為「yes」，訊息將從語音信箱刪除（在寄送電子郵件後）。此功能讓使用者僅能透過電子郵件接收語音信箱，而無法從網頁介面或分機話機擫取語音信箱。警告：必須將「附加語音信箱至電子郵件」設為 YES，否則您的訊息將永遠遺失。"

#: functions.inc.php:544
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If set to \"yes\" then when someone dials this voicemail box they will not "
"be able to access the voicemail menu by pressing (*). If you have no plans "
"to access your mailbox remotely set this to \"yes\""
msgstr "若設為「yes」，當有人撥打此語音信箱時，將無法按 (*) 存取語音信箱選單。若您不打算從遠端存取信箱，請將此設為「yes」"

#: page.voicemail.php:267
msgid ""
"If the \"pollmailboxes\" option is enabled, this option sets the polling "
"frequency.  The default is once every 30 seconds."
msgstr "若啟用「pollmailboxes」選項，此選項會設定輪詢頻率。預設為每 30 秒一次。"

#: views/dialplan.php:228
msgid ""
"If the Max Loops are reached and the call goes to voicemail, checking this "
"box will disable the standard voicemail prompt prompt that follows the "
"user's recorded greeting. This default can be overriden with a unique ..vmx/"
"vmxopts/loops AstDB entry for the given mode (busy/unavail) and user."
msgstr ""
"若已達到最大循環數且來電轉至語音信箱，勾選此方塊將停用使用者錄製問候語之後的標準語音信箱提示。此預設值可透過指定模式（忙線/不可用）和使用者的唯一 ..vmx/vmxopts/loops AstDB 條目覆寫。"

#: views/dialplan.php:255
msgid ""
"If the special advanced extension of 'dovm' is used, checking this box will "
"disable the standard voicemail prompt prompt that follows the user's "
"recorded greeting. This default can be overriden with a unique ..vmx/vmxopts/"
"dovm AstDB entry for the given mode (busy/unavail) and user."
msgstr ""
"若使用特殊的進階分機 'dovm'，勾選此方塊將停用使用者錄製問候語之後的標準語音信箱提示。此預設值可透過指定模式（忙線/不可用）和使用者的唯一 ..vmx/vmxopts/dovm AstDB 條目覆寫。"

#: page.voicemail.php:237
